            "Key": "YewSeed",
            "SourceString": "I had a friend called Ewan who had a yew orchard, and decided that he would let his female sheep graze there. It was the source of much hilarity, I tell you. \r\n\r\nA yew seed, you might not know, is actually called an 'aril'. It comes from the middle of a yew's red berry. It's also dangerously poisonous, so we'll add that to the long list of things in Ashenfall that are trying to kill you. ",
